ration tradeoffs: A comparison of Claude Opus 4.5 and 4.6</h3><p class="css-tlrqvx e1yv2nyc5">We recently ran a small experiment to see how Claude Opus 4.5 and the newer Opus 4.6 handled a specific backend task. The goal wasn't to see which one was necessarily better, but to understand the differences in their coding styles.</p><p class="css-1we3tt6 e1yv2nyc4">Read article &gt;</p></div>]]></content>
